6. Compare the predictors
We joined the three prediction tables by RNA ID and nucleotide position so that every method was evaluated against exactly the same reference labels. We compared ECE, Brier score and log loss and generated a reliability plot showing predicted pairing probability against the observed fraction of paired nucleotides.


